/* ===========================================================================
 * MODE NOTE (why this file looks the way it does)
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * SD_MODE on this board is hardwired to logic 1 (confirmed via IOIN readback
 * in the previous iteration), which means the internal ramp generator can
 * NEVER be used -- RAMPMODE / VMAX / AMAX / XTARGET etc. are all ignored by
 * the chip in this state. Motion must come from external STEP/DIR pulses.
 * SPI (SPI_MODE=1, still active) is used ONLY for configuration: current
 * (IHOLD_IRUN, GLOBAL_SCALER), microstepping/chopper (CHOPCONF), diagnostics
 * routing (GCONF), and for reading back status (DRV_STATUS, GSTAT, IOIN).
 * =========================================================================*/

